  - m_Id: 966328862
    m_Localized: Apply 5 Poison to all enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966328863
    m_Localized: Snake Venom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966328864
    m_Localized: Apply 3 Stun to all enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966328865
    m_Localized: Electric Shock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966328866
    m_Localized: Immediately reshuffle the draw deck without spending a turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966328867
    m_Localized: Deck Reshuffler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966328868
    m_Localized: Immediately recover 20 HP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966328869
    m_Localized: Healing Potion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966328870
    m_Localized: Swap positions with the nearest enemy in front of you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966328871
    m_Localized: Magic Coin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966328872
    m_Localized: LOADING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966328873
    m_Localized: Check the order of your loaded bullets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 966328874
    m_Localized: Use shops to prepare for the next battle.
    m_Metadata:
