  - m_Id: 970522941
    m_Localized: STATISTICS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 970522942
    m_Localized: "<size=100><color=yellow>LOADED</color></size>\n| Take down outlaws.
      Collect the bounty.\n\nYou are a bounty hunter arriving in a town overrun with
      outlaws.\nRead your enemies' moves and build your bullet deck to clean up the
      town.\n\n<color=purple>[3 Core Rules]</color>\n<color=orange>1.</color> You
      can preview enemy attacks before they happen.\n<color=orange>2.</color> Bullets
      fire in cylinder order. \n<color=orange>3.</color> Changing the loaded bullet
      order changes the outcome of your attack.\n\n<color=purple>[Tips]</color>\n<color=orange>1.</color>
      Hover over a bullet to preview damage before firing!\n<color=orange>2.</color>
      Check your bullet order and synergies before every shot!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
