    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716975
    m_Localized: Mark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716976
    m_Localized: Cylinder Tempo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716977
    m_Localized: 'Time does not pass on its own. Only <color=#FFD05A><b>player actions</b></color>
      charge Cylinder Tempo.

      Moving uses 2 segment; turning or waiting uses
      1; loading or firing uses 3.

      At <color=#FF5757><b>6 segments</b></color>,
      every enemy acts once. Move as an attack lands to dodge it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716978
    m_Localized: Enemy Attack Warnings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716979
    m_Localized: 'A <color=#FF5757><b>warning sound</b></color> plays when an enemy
      prepares to attack.

      The <color=#FF5757><b>action panel below the enemy</b></color>
      also turns red.

      Ranged attacks show their path and area.

      Move
      away or prepare before the next enemy action cycle.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716980
    m_Localized: Dodging and Exposure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716981
    m_Localized: '<color=#62D9FF><b>Move out of the attack area</b></color> just
      before the hit lands to dodge.

      An enemy whose attack you dodge becomes
      <color=#FF9F5A><b>Exposed</b></color>. The next hit against it is a guaranteed
      critical hit.

      Exposed ends when the enemy is <color=#FFD05A><b>hit once</b></color>
      or takes <color=#FF5757><b>any action other than attacking</b></color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716982
    m_Localized: 'Core Strategy: Bullet Order'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716983
    m_Localized: '<color=#FFD05A><b>Bullet order changes your damage.</b></color>

      The
      cylinder fires <color=#FFD05A><b>the most recently loaded bullet first</b></color>.
      Bullet effects can interact with earlier and later shots.

      Before firing,
      <color=#FF5757><b>drag bullets</b></color> to reorder them and compare <color=#FFD05A><b>predicted
      damage</b></color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716984
    m_Localized: Range and Direction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716985
    m_Localized: 'Bullets fire in <color=#FFD05A><b>the direction you face</b></color>.

      Each
      bullet has its own <color=#FFD05A><b>range</b></color>.

      Check <color=#FFD05A><b>Range:
      N tiles</b></color> in the bullet tooltip.

      If no damage is predicted,
      check <color=#FFD05A><b>your direction, distance, and enemies blocking the
      shot</b></color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716986
    m_Localized: Combos and the 4-Segment Gauge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716987
    m_Localized: 'Defeating an enemy fills <color=#FFD05A><b>4 combo segments</b></color>.

      One
      segment expires each time Cylinder Tempo reaches 6 and <color=#FF5757><b>an
      enemy action cycle is committed</b></color>.

      Defeat another enemy before
      the gauge empties to refill it to 4 segments and keep your combo going.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716988
    m_Localized: Debuff Types
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716989
    m_Localized: '<color=#FF7D7D><b>Mark: take 50% more damage</b></color>

      <color=#78D987><b>Poison:
      take damage equal to stacks at the end of an enemy cycle, then lose 1 stack</b></color>

      <color=#75C7FF><b>Stun:
      unable to act during the enemy cycle, then lose 1 stack</b></color>

      <color=#C69CFF><b>Weakness:
      attack damage reduced by 30%</b></color>

      <color=#FF9F5A><b>Exposed:
      a non-stacking debuff applied to an enemy when you dodge its attack. The next
      hit is a guaranteed critical hit. Ends on that hit or another action</b></color>

      Debuffed
      enemies display status icons like these.

      <color=#FF5757><b>Hover over
      an icon</b></color> to inspect its effect.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716990
    m_Localized: The Map and Your Route
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716991
    m_Localized: 'Choose your route for the current run on the map.

      Follow
      a <color=#8FE6FF><b>bright path</b></color> from your current position to the
      next node.

      You cannot turn back after choosing a route, so check the
      nodes ahead.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716992
    m_Localized: Node Types
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716993
    m_Localized: '<color=#B8C6D9><b>Start</b></color>: the beginning of your run

      <color=#FFD05A><b>Battle</b></color>:
      fight regular enemies

      <color=#FF8D6B><b>Elite Battle</b></color>: fight
      stronger enemies

      <color=#76E38A><b>Shop</b></color>: buy, sell, and
      manage bullets

      <color=#C69CFF><b>Event</b></color>: your choices shape
      the outcome

      <color=#8FE6FF><b>Treasure</b></color>: obtain relics and
      rewards

      <color=#FF5757><b>Boss</b></color>: the stage''s final battle'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716994
    m_Localized: Choose the Next Node
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716995
    m_Localized: 'Nodes you can visit now are <color=#FFD05A><b>highlighted</b></color>.

      Hover
      over a node to see its type and description.

      <color=#FF5757><b>Left-click
      a node</b></color> to travel there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716996
    m_Localized: Move
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716997
    m_Localized: 'Use <color=#FF5757><b>WASD</b></color> to move one tile. A/D move
      along the battlefield; W/S switch lanes.

      Movement uses <color=#FFD05A><b>2
      Cylinder Tempo segment</b></color>. Enemies act when it reaches 6.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716998
    m_Localized: Move one tile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974716999
    m_Localized: Turn Around
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717000
    m_Localized: 'Press <color=#FF5757><b>Q</b></color>, <color=#FF5757><b>middle-click</b></color>,
      or <color=#FF5757><b>click Turn Around</b></color> to change direction.

      Bullets
      fire in <color=#FFD05A><b>the direction you face</b></color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717001
    m_Localized: Turn around once
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717002
    m_Localized: Wait
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717003
    m_Localized: Press <color=#FF5757><b>E</b></color> or <color=#FF5757><b>click
      Wait</b></color> to use 1 Cylinder Tempo segments without moving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717004
    m_Localized: Wait once
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717005
    m_Localized: Inspect Enemy Actions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717006
    m_Localized: 'Check the <color=#FFD05A><b>action icon below an enemy</b></color>
      to see its next move.

      If no icon is visible, advance Cylinder Tempo,
      then <color=#FF5757><b>hover over or click the icon</b></color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717007
    m_Localized: Inspect an enemy action icon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717008
    m_Localized: Load
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717009
    m_Localized: 'Press <color=#FF5757><b>R</b></color> or <color=#FF5757><b>click
      Load</b></color> to load the next bullet.

      Loading uses <color=#FFD05A><b>3
      Cylinder Tempo segments</b></color>.

      Check the remaining tempo and enemy
      actions first.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717010
    m_Localized: Load 3 times
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717011
    m_Localized: Empty a Chamber
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717012
    m_Localized: '<color=#FF5757><b>Right-click</b></color> the bullet you want to
      remove from the cylinder.

      The bullet moves into the <color=#FFD05A><b>spent-bullet
      cycle</b></color> without being destroyed.

      Emptying a chamber <color=#FFD05A><b>uses
      no Cylinder Tempo.</b></color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717013
    m_Localized: Right-click a loaded bullet to remove it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717014
    m_Localized: Read Bullet Information
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717015
    m_Localized: '<color=#FF5757><b>Hover over</b></color> a loaded bullet or the
      next bullet.

      Check its <color=#FFD05A><b>damage, range, critical chance,
      and special effects</b></color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717016
    m_Localized: Check a bullet's damage and range
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717017
    m_Localized: Reorder the Cylinder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717018
    m_Localized: '<color=#FFD05A><b>Bullet order changes your damage.</b></color>

      <color=#FF5757><b>Drag
      a loaded bullet</b></color> onto another bullet.

      The <color=#FFD05A><b>most
      recently loaded bullet fires first</b></color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717019
    m_Localized: Change the bullet order once
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717020
    m_Localized: Predicted Enemy Damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717021
    m_Localized: '<color=#FF5757><b>Hover over a loaded bullet.</b></color>

      Enemy
      health bars show <color=#FFD05A><b>predicted damage</b></color> from firing
      up to that bullet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717022
    m_Localized: Check predicted damage from a loaded bullet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717023
    m_Localized: Use an Item
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717024
    m_Localized: 'You receive <color=#FFD05A><b>Electric Shock</b></color>, which
      stuns all enemies.

      Use it with <color=#FF5757><b>1/2/3</b></color> or
      by <color=#FF5757><b>clicking its inventory slot</b></color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717025
    m_Localized: Use Electric Shock once
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717026
    m_Localized: Kick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717027
    m_Localized: 'Move toward an enemy directly in front of you to kick it.

      Use
      <color=#FF5757><b>A/D</b></color> or <color=#FF5757><b>click a movement button</b></color>.

      After
      kicking, you must take <color=#FFD05A><b>3 actions that cost tempo</b></color>
      before kicking again.

      When enemies collide, <color=#FFD05A><b>both take
      damage</b></color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717028
    m_Localized: Kick an enemy once
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717029
    m_Localized: Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717030
    m_Localized: '<color=#FF5757><b>Left-click the screen</b></color>, press <color=#FF5757><b>Space</b></color>,
      or <color=#FF5757><b>click Shoot</b></color> to <color=#FFD05A><b>fire all
      loaded bullets in order</b></color>.

      Check <color=#FFD05A><b>your facing,
      range, and bullet order</b></color> before firing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717031
    m_Localized: Fire the cylinder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717032
    m_Localized: Buy Goods
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717033
    m_Localized: 'Buy <color=#FFD05A><b>bullets and items</b></color> from the upper
      section.

      Hover over goods to check their <color=#FFD05A><b>effects and
      prices</b></color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717034
    m_Localized: Bullet Management
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717035
    m_Localized: 'Use Bullet Management to <color=#FFD05A><b>upgrade or remove</b></color>
      owned bullets.

      The cost appears below the selected bullet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717036
    m_Localized: Inventory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717037
    m_Localized: 'Check your <color=#FFD05A><b>owned items</b></color> in the inventory
      on the left.

      In battles, shops, events, and treasure rooms, <color=#FF5757><b>right-click
      an item</b></color> to sell it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717038
    m_Localized: Refresh
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717039
    m_Localized: 'If nothing catches your eye, <color=#FFD05A><b>refresh the stock</b></color>.

      Each
      refresh increases the next refresh cost.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717040
    m_Localized: Next Battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717041
    m_Localized: 'Press this button when you have finished <color=#FFD05A><b>shopping
      and managing bullets</b></color>.

      The <color=#FFD05A><b>next battle</b></color>
      will begin.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717042
    m_Localized: Read the Event
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717043
    m_Localized: 'Read the event''s <color=#FFD05A><b>title and situation</b></color>.

      The
      same event can have different outcomes depending on your choices.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717044
    m_Localized: Choices and Outcomes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717045
    m_Localized: 'Choices may involve <color=#FFD05A><b>costs, requirements, and
      success chances</b></color>.

      Read the options, make your choice, and
      see what happens.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717046
    m_Localized: Open a Treasure Chest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717047
    m_Localized: Click the chest to reveal the <color=#FFD05A><b>relics you can choose
      from</b></color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717048
    m_Localized: Choose a Relic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717049
    m_Localized: 'Hover over each relic to read its effect, then <color=#FF5757><b>choose
      one</b></color>.

      Your chosen relic grants a special effect for the current
      run.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717050
    m_Localized: Use an Item
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717051
    m_Localized: 'Use an item by pressing <color=#FF5757><b>1/2/3</b></color> or
      <color=#FF5757><b>clicking its inventory slot</b></color>.

      <color=#FFD05A><b>Items
      are not consumed if their requirements are not met.</b></color>

      Try
      again after enemies appear.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
