    m_Localized: AI Behavior
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717185
    m_Localized: Approaches the player and telegraphs an attack, then retreats to
      its preferred distance afterward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717186
    m_Localized: Registers attack tiles first, then approaches within range. Once
      it has a clear shot, it prepares to fire on the next COUNT.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717187
    m_Localized: Range covers the entire board. Locks onto the player's tile when
      preparing, then throws.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717188
    m_Localized: Heals an injured ally at any distance. If no ally needs healing,
      shields the frontmost ally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 974717189
    m_Localized: 'Repeats a fixed sequence: throw bombs, adjust distance, fire a
      shotgun to both sides, and reload.'
